{"id": "b0f1972d-7b6d-4c61-8da5-201950821618", "slug": "masterclass-intro-heading-component", "title": "Masterclass Intro Heading Component", "description": "Masterclass Intro Heading Component is designed for presenting section hierarchy and emphasis. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are designed", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Masterclass Intro Heading Component\"\ndescription: \"Masterclass Intro Heading Component is designed for presenting section hierarchy and emphasis. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are designed\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00C2FF\"\n  secondary: \"#110E15\"\n  accent: \"#FFEA00\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0C\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Masterclass Intro Heading Component\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 2; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: heading, animated, dither, branding, effect.\n## Overview\nMasterclass Intro Heading Component is designed for presenting section hierarchy and emphasis. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are designed\n\nA high-end animated intro featuring technical grid lines and a bold typographic reveal for design professionals.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Master the interface you were meant to design..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00C2FF, secondary #110E15, accent #FFEA00, background #0A0A0C, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>UI/UX Design Masterclass</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0c] text-zinc-200 min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden relative font-sans antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Skill: Container Lines & Mini Squares -->\n    <!-- Vertical Lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-16 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/5 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"line-v-1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-16 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/5 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"line-v-2\"></div>\n    <!-- Horizontal Lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-16 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/5 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"line-h-1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-16 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/5 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"line-h-2\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Intersection Squares -->\n    <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-16 top-16 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zinc-700 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);\" id=\"sq-1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-16 top-16 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zinc-700 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);\" id=\"sq-2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-16 bottom-16 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zinc-700 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);\" id=\"sq-3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-16 bottom-16 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zinc-700 translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);\" id=\"sq-4\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Skill: Number Details -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-20 left-10 md:left-20 flex flex-col gap-1 z-10\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px);\" id=\"number-detail\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 tracking-widest\">01</span>\n        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">Sequence Start</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Stage -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Skill: Border Gradient (via nested divs) -->\n        <div id=\"main-card-wrapper\" class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-500/40 via-zinc-800/10 to-zinc-600/30 shadow-2xl shadow-black w-full max-w-5xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.85);\">\n\n            <!-- Inner Card -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#110e15] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full relative min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                <!-- Left Content Area -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 p-10 md:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Skill: Solar Duotone Bold Icons -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8);\" id=\"icon-group\">\n                        <div class=\"h-8 w-8 rounded-lg bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center border border-white/10\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:figma-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-xl text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-xl text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-6 leading-[1.1]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(10px);\" id=\"main-title\">\n                        Master the interface<br/>you were meant to design.\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-md mb-10 leading-relaxed font-normal\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(10px);\" id=\"sub-title\">\n                        Elevate your product logic. Learn the systematic approach to layout, typography, and motion choreography.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\" id=\"cta-button\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-white text-black text-xs md:text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 w-max\">\n                            Schedule a Demo\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Visual Area (Reference Image Stripes) -->\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-shrink-0 h-full absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 items-stretch gap-3 pl-12 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-[#110e15] z-0\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-[#00c2ff] origin-right\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0);\" id=\"stripe-1\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2.5 bg-[#ffea00] origin-right\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0);\" id=\"stripe-2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-5 bg-[#ff8a00] origin-right\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0);\" id=\"stripe-3\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-10 bg-[#ff3d3d] origin-right\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0);\" id=\"stripe-4\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-16 bg-[#ff0066] origin-right\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0);\" id=\"stripe-5\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n            // Elements\n            const lines = [document.getElementById('line-v-1'), document.getElementById('line-v-2'), document.getElementById('line-h-1'), document.getElementById('line-h-2')];\n            const squares = [document.getElementById('sq-1'), document.getElementById('sq-2'), document.getElementById('sq-3'), document.getElementById('sq-4')];\n            const numberDetail = document.getElementById('number-detail');\n            const mainCard = document.getElementById('main-card-wrapper');\n            const iconGroup = document.getElementById('icon-group');\n            const mainTitle = document.getElementById('main-title');\n            const subTitle = document.getElementById('sub-title');\n            const ctaButton = document.getElementById('cta-button');\n            const stripes = [\n                document.getElementById('stripe-1'),\n                document.getElementById('stripe-2'),\n                document.getElementById('stripe-3'),\n                document.getElementById('stripe-4'),\n                document.getElementById('stripe-5')\n            ];\n\n            // Fallback for reduced motion\n            if (prefersReducedMotion) {\n                const allAnimated = [...lines, ...squares, numberDetail, mainCard, iconGroup, mainTitle, subTitle, ctaButton, ...stripes];\n                allAnimated.forEach(el => {\n                    if(el) {\n                        el.style.opacity = '1';\n                        el.style.transform = 'none';\n                    }\n                });\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Easing functions\n            const easeOutExpo = 'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n            const easeOutBack = 'cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n            const easeInOutQuint = 'cubic-bezier(0.83, 0, 0.17, 1)';\n\n            // Phase 1: Environment Build (0s - 1s)\n            lines.forEach((line, i) => {\n                line.animate(\n                    { opacity: [0, 1] },\n                    { duration: 1000, delay: i * 100, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards' }\n                );\n            });\n\n            squares.forEach((sq, i) => {\n                sq.animate(\n                    { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0)', 'scale(1)'] },\n                    { duration: 600, delay: 400 + (i * 100), easing: easeOutBack, fill: 'forwards' }\n                );\n            });\n\n            numberDetail.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['translateY(-10px)', 'translateY(0)'] },\n                { duration: 800, delay: 600, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            // Phase 2: Main Card Scale & Content (1s - 2.5s)\n            mainCard.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0.85) translateY(20px)', 'scale(1) translateY(0)'] },\n                { duration: 1400, delay: 800, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            iconGroup.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0.8)', 'scale(1)'] },\n                { duration: 800, delay: 1200, easing: easeOutBack, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            mainTitle.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0.95) translateY(10px)', 'scale(1) translateY(0)'] },\n                { duration: 1000, delay: 1300, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            subTitle.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0.95) translateY(10px)', 'scale(1) translateY(0)'] },\n                { duration: 1000, delay: 1450, easing: easeOutExpo, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            ctaButton.animate(\n                { opacity: [0, 1], transform: ['scale(0.9)', 'scale(1)'] },\n                { duration: 800, delay: 1600, easing: easeOutBack, fill: 'forwards' }\n            );\n\n            // Phase 3: Climax - Stripes Reveal (2s - 3.5s)\n            stripes.forEach((stripe, i) => {\n                stripe.animate(\n                    { transform: ['scaleX(0)', 'scaleX(1)'] },\n                    { duration: 1200, delay: 1800 + (i * 120), easing: easeInOutQuint, fill: 'forwards' }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // Phase 4: Resolve - Subtle Breathing (Starts after intro)\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                mainCard.animate(\n                    { transform: ['scale(1)', 'scale(1.005)', 'scale(1)'] },\n                    { duration: 6000, iterations: Infinity, easing: 'ease-in-out' }\n                );\n            }, 3000);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "masterclass-intro-heading-component.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/masterclass-intro-heading-component.jpg", "source_name": "masterclass-intro-heading-component-DESIGN.md", "views": 55, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:35:38.194332+00:00"}